Note on data: this repository does not redistribute the evaluation datasets.
They are fetched by the scripts in `datasets/` from their original sources and
carry their own licenses — deepset/prompt-injections (Apache-2.0) and
TrustAIRLab/in-the-wild-jailbreak-prompts (MIT). The committed `gold_labels.jsonl`
contains only IDs and labels (no prompt text).
